  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Hyper-G Round is the smooth, round member of the Hyper-G family, designed to enhance ball penetration, power and directional control. Its proprietary chemical formulation creates an explosive response while the low-friction round surface makes it especially effective in hybrid setups. Solinco specifically recommends pairing it with Hyper-G and Hyper-G Soft, and it can also be combined with synthetic gut, multifilament or natural gut strings. Available in 1.15, 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges.",

    "zh": "Solinco Hyper-G Round 是 Hyper-G 家族中的圆形光滑版本，核心特点是增强击球穿透力、力量输出和方向控制。其专有化学配方提供爆发性击球反馈，而低摩擦圆形表面则使它特别适合 Hybrid 混穿。Solinco 官方明确推荐与 Hyper-G 和 Hyper-G Soft 搭配，同时也可以与 Synthetic Gut、多芯线或天然肠线组合使用。提供 1.15、1.20、1.25 与 1.30 毫米四种线径。"
  },

